        <div class="article-grid">
            <div class="main-articles">
                <article class="article-card">
                    <div class="article-container-text">
                        <h2 class="article-headline">About The Beltway Times</h2>
                        <p class="article-excerpt">
                            Real-world themes. Completely fabricated stories. Unsubtle satire. We chronicle what never
                            actually happened and who definitely didn't say what—then you decide if it could pass for
                            reality.
                        </p>
                        <div class="my-3">
                            <h3 class="text-red mb-2">Our Mission</h3>
                            <p class="lh-1-6 mb-3">
                                Highlight the strange political discourse through news that never happened, but is 100%
                                believable.
                            </p>

                            <h3 class="text-red mb-2">How We Work</h3>
                            <p class="lh-1-6 mb-3">
                                We start with fictional premises inspired by real-world topics. Satire is our lens;
                                fiction is our source material.
                            </p>

                            <h3 class="text-red mb-2">Editorial Values</h3>
                            <ul class="lh-1-6 mb-3">
                                <li>Clarity over cynicism; punchlines should illuminate, not obscure.</li>
                                <li>Punch up; critique power, not powerlessness.</li>
                                <li>Entertain.</li>
                            </ul>

                            <h3 class="text-red mb-2">Reader’s Guide</h3>
                            <ul class="lh-1-6 mb-3">
                                <li>If you laugh and wince at the same time, you’re reading it correctly.</li>
                            </ul>

                            <div class="about-disclaimer my-3">
                                <p class="m-0 italic text-gray">

                                    LEGAL DISCLAIMER: This is a satirical publication. All articles are for
                                    entertainment purposes only.

                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                    </div>
            </div>
            </article>
        </div>
